{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2022-07-26 07:00:00', 'title': 'CORESITE EXECUTIVES APPOINTED TO KEY DATA CENTER COALITION ROLES', 'text': "DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CORESITE, A LEADING HYBRID IT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER AND SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) (“AMERICAN TOWER”), TODAY ANNOUNCED SEVERAL OF THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVES HAVE BEEN APPOINTED TO ROLES WITHIN THE DATA CENTER COALITION (DCC). THE DCC REPRESENTS AND ADVANCES THE INTERESTS OF THE DATA CENTER COMMUNITY AND ADVOCATES FOR A STRONG BUSINESS CLIMATE, POLICIES AND INVESTMENTS THAT SUPPORT THE GROWTH AND SUCCESS OF THIS BUSINESS SECTOR. CORESITE, STRATEGICAL"}